ry\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years. In 2025, November to December finished at 37% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 40% of normal on the middle. Grid 15762 had its driest year in 1952 at 58%.</p>"}
